Grilling King was added in '''Beta 57.0''' as a 5/6 for 10G monster with the ability to kill a single damaged monster of your choice (fittingly functioning as a small [[Asgore]]), while also dealing that monster's ATK as DMG to the opponent. '''Beta 58.0''' gave it +3 cost as well as a new ability (and a new sprite). It will now summon a 5/5 Cake and two 3/3 Spincakes onto your board, thus filling it up entirely, but only if you have more monsters in your dustpile than cards in your deck.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 5

HP: 6

Cost:

* 10 (Post Beta 57.0)
* 13 (Post Beta 58.0, Current)

Abilities:

* Magic: Kill a damaged monster and deal its ATK as DMG to the opponent. (Post Beta 57.0)
* Need: More cards in your dustpile than your deck. Magic: Summon 1 5/5 Cake and 2 3/3 Spincakes. (Post Beta 58.0, Current)

Rarity: Gold (Legendary)

Song: Bring It In, Guys! (Asgore Scene)
